  "summary": {
    "zh": "折叠机身配光流定位、双摄像头和4.3英寸屏控，支持Wi-Fi图传。",
    "en": "A folding airframe with optical flow, dual cameras and a 4.3-inch screen controller for Wi-Fi FPV."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "折叠机身配光流定位、双摄像头和4.3英寸屏控，支持Wi-Fi图传。",
      "机身采用折叠结构，资料列有定高、光流定位和六轴陀螺仪。",
      "机身电池为3.7 V、2000 mAh，遥控器内置3.7 V、1500 mAh电池，USB充电且适配器需另购。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "A folding airframe with optical flow, dual cameras and a 4.3-inch screen controller for Wi-Fi FPV.",
      "The folding body is listed with altitude hold, optical-flow positioning and a six-axis gyroscope.",
      "The drone battery is listed as 3.7 V, 2,000 mAh and the controller has a built-in 3.7 V, 1,500 mAh battery."
    ]
  },
