      "text": {
        "zh": "前置480P Wi-Fi镜头与底部镜头可切换，4.3英寸屏控用于查看实时画面。镜头角度和舵机云台结构以当前出货配置为准。",
        "en": "The 480p Wi-Fi front camera and lower camera can be switched from the 4.3-inch screen controller. Confirm the camera angle and servo-gimbal configuration against the shipment."
