    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "光流定位与折叠机身",
        "en": "Optical flow and folding body"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/ES800Pro/52c01c023b73.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "机身采用折叠结构，资料列有定高、光流定位和六轴陀螺仪。收纳时先折好机臂并保护镜头，起飞前检查桨叶和电量。",
        "en": "The folding body is listed with altitude hold, optical-flow positioning and a six-axis gyroscope. Fold the arms for storage, protect the cameras, and check propellers and battery before flight."
      }
    },
    {
